      "journal": {
        "initial": "TC167 is in no condition to move. I should look for transportation before trying to reach the airport.",
        "complete": "I found a working utility vehicle and reached the maintenance hangar. Next, I need equipment capable of carrying TC167.",
        "hangar": "The hangar is still standing. There's enough room here to work on TC167, assuming I can find a way to get her inside. There must have been ground support equipment somewhere around this airbase.",
        "discover": "A utility vehicle. I wasn't expecting to find one intact. Now the question is whether it still works.",
        "inspect": "It appears to be in better condition than most of the equipment I've seen. I might actually be able to get this thing moving.",
        "compound": "There are several buildings between the crash site and the airport. They look like some kind of service facility. I can't see any movement, but the structures appear to be reasonably intact. It's worth investigating before I attempt the journey to the airbase."
      }
